  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Blue Me Away, our luxurious beach house! Blue Me Away is named after the sensation we strive for you to experience during your stay. The beautiful blue waters of Blue Mountain Beach allow you to get away from all the stress that everyday life might create. We would love to have you come stay with us. <br><br>Our home is in a private gated community, The Villages at Blue Mountain Beach, right off the scenic 30A corridor. 30A is a highly sought after stretch of highway along Florida’s coast between Destin and Panama City. Each village along 30A has its own unique characteristics that offer a magical portrait along some of the country’s most beautiful beaches. The pristine sugar white sand of Blue Mountain Beach on the Emerald Coast is one of the least crowded public access beaches on 30A. Any kind of fun in the sun you might imagine can be enjoyed within a short distance of our home. Amazing food, shopping, entertainment and concert life ALL along 30A. While you are visiting you can enjoy all the perks of beach life, fishing (fresh water or salt water), walking, hiking, bike trails, surfing, kayaking, visit the State Park and the list goes on…You won’t regret it!<br><br>We are a short walk, bike or golf cart ride from the Blue Mountain Beach entrance which conveniently offers public restrooms. We are located .6 miles from a variety of public beach accesses. We are 2 miles from neighboring communities like Seaside and Watercolor and the outlet mall is only a 15-minute drive!<br><br>Our property is located on a corner lot within our gated community. The village is well known for its charm, quiet atmosphere, beautiful sidewalks perfect for outdoor play, bike rides or relaxing walks and well-maintained amenities. We are conveniently located across the street from the gated pool and fitness center, also equipped with cornhole and shuffleboard. <br><br>Our individualized keyless check-in process allows you the ability to begin your vacation from the moment you arrive. <br><br>Blue Me Away is a 3-story luxurious open concept home with high ceilings, travertine and hardwood floors sleeps a maximum of 8 adults. Complete with 5 bedrooms, 4 full bathrooms, 2 half bathrooms, game room and office. <br><br>Main Living Area - Bottom floor: Offers a fully equipped gourmet kitchen, top of the line appliances, and granite countertops. The chef in your family will enjoy their cooking experience here. Once meals are served seating will be no issue with 4 bar stool seats and an oversized dining table for 8. The living room boasts a large flat screen tv and an oversized couch for relaxation while watching TV, movies or enjoying the game. An oversized powder bath is also located on the bottom floor along with a laundry room and large utility sink.<br><br>2nd Floor: Contains a master suite complete with a king bed, huge en suite bathroom and master closet, a queen bedroom with full bathroom and balcony for breathtaking sunset views, a full over full bunk bedroom with full bathroom and an office space. <br><br>3rd floor: Complete with a master suite king bed, large en suite bathroom with master closet, balcony, twin bunk room with 2 sets of built-in bunk beds (4 beds total), a game room with foosball table stocked with games for your enjoyment during your stay, a fold down couch, a half bathroom and reading area.<br><br>Outdoor space: Complete with 2 parking spaces an outdoor shower, patio dining and gas grill.<br><br>For your protection and ours RING cameras are install at all main level external points of entry.<br><br>Please come partake in the 30A life and experience the breathtaking beach atmosphere where memories will be made that will last a lifetime. We look forward to your stay at Blue Me Away!<br><br>Features: <br>-\tLocated at The Village at Blue Mountain Beach<br>-\tLarge community pool<br>-\tFitness Center<br>-\tShuffleboard Court<br>-\tCornhole<br>-\tOutdoor Shower<br>-\tGas grill<br>-\tPatio seating<br>-\tMultiple balconies<br>-\t3 story home<br>-\t5 bedrooms<br>-\t4 bathrooms<br>-\t2 powder baths<br>-\tWasher and Dryer<br>-\tFully equipped kitchen<br>-\tFull size refrigerator with ice maker<br>-\tFull size stove with oven<br>-\tMicrowave<br>-\tKeurig<br>- Standard coffee maker<br>-\tGranite Countertops<br>-\tBar seating for 4<br>-\tDining room seating for 8 <br>-\t2 king master suites<br>-\t1 queen room<br>-\t1 full over full bunk room<br>- 2 sets of twin built-in bunk beds room<br>-\t1 fold down couch/futon<br>-\tGame room<br>-\tOffice <br>-\tReading area<br>-\tComplimentary wireless internet<br>-\tOverflow parking nearby<br>-\tClose proximity to beach, local restaurants and shopping<br>",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
